<main id="main" class="community-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>What this website uses and displays.</h1><p class="page-intro">This page describes the LineClash website and its community directory. Individual game servers are operated separately.</p>
<section class="community-section"><h2>Public game information</h2><p>Participating servers report their public address, name, availability and population. Reported match history can include nicknames, teams, results, gameplay statistics and replay events. This information appears in the server browser, statistics, player pages and public API.</p><p>Nicknames are local to each server. Choose a nickname you are comfortable displaying publicly. For questions about a reported match, contact the operator of the server that submitted it.</p></section>
<section class="community-section"><h2>Website requests</h2><p>The website does not set application cookies or include an analytics script. The hosting server may record ordinary access and error logs, including request details and network addresses; log retention is controlled by the site operator.</p><p>Fonts load from Google Fonts. The download section requests public release information from GitHub. Your browser connects to those services, which receive the network information needed to answer the requests. Following an external link is governed by the destination’s own privacy practices.</p></section>
